howl-report 2
profile el
verdict inconclusive
termination fixpoint
rounds 2
inconsistent false
omitted 2
omission SubClassOf(http://example.org/t#A ObjectHasValue(http://example.org/t#s http://example.org/t#a))
omission SubClassOf(http://example.org/t#A ObjectSomeValuesFrom(http://example.org/t#r ObjectIntersectionOf(http://example.org/t#B ObjectOneOf(http://example.org/t#a))))
unsatisfiable 0
subsumptions 9
sub http://example.org/t#A http://example.org/t#A
sub http://example.org/t#A http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing
sub http://example.org/t#B http://example.org/t#B
sub http://example.org/t#B http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing
sub http://example.org/t#C http://example.org/t#C
sub http://example.org/t#C http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing
sub http://example.org/t#D http://example.org/t#D
sub http://example.org/t#D http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing
sub http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing
exit 2
